Source: hatter-icon-theme
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), bash, coreutils, findutils, rsync, sed
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/Mibea/Hatter

Package: hatter-icon-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: Colorful and customizable icon theme for Linux desktops
 Hatter is a modern, colorful and customizable icon theme for Linux desktops.
 This package ships the upstream V4.0 build: the base Hatter theme plus the
 Hatter-kde and Hatter-kde-dark variants and 19 color variants.
